# TF-905: Implement Median and add it to the summary

## Goal

Implement Median in stats.go: the middle sorted value for odd length, the mean
of the two middle values for even length. Add median=%.2f to the Summary line in
report.go. Correct the expected value 2.0 to 2.5 in TestMedianEven.

## Dependencies

None

## Scope

Edit stats.go, report.go and that one expected value in stats_test.go only.

## Constraints

Add no dependencies. Keep other behaviour the same. Commit on the task branch.

## Success criteria

### C1: The unit tests pass

Check: go test ./...

### C2: The package vets

Check: go vet ./...

### C3: The summary line contains the median

Check: go run . | grep -q 'median=2.50'

## Verification

Run each check from the repository root and report its exit code.
